# The planetary moons' ephemeris files Astrolog 8.00 asks for: 27 moons and the
# centres of body of Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune and Pluto. About 240 MB.
# One list for both routes: the Dockerfile's moons stage and scripts/build-astrolog
# read it, and both fetch each file from
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aloistr/swisseph/<commit>/ephe/sat/<file>
# at commit 94621aba9f3ff9c32cb721eac0380c30dbb153fe (Alois Treindl's swisseph
# repository). Upstream publishes no checksums: these sha256 are OURS, taken
# once from the files at that commit and cross-checked against GitHub's blob
# SHA-1 of each. Format: sha256sum's, "<sha256>  <file>"; lines starting with #
# are comments.
